    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35579" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνθερμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hot,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					6.4.13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἷμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					898a6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνεῦμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Zeno Stoic.
					1.38
				</span></i>
			, Antip.ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.251
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Αιβύη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.951f
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>passionate,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μειράκιον</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				24.10D.
			</span></i>; <i>hot, fervid,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάνοια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Phgn.</u>
					806b26
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.605
			</span></i>, al.</div>
